		"description": "<p>Drawing a fingertip across your weapon, you briefly inscribe a glowing mark before you strike your opponent, which reminds them of your threat when they seek to engage others. Your mark is transferred to the next creature you strike with the inscribed weapon. If the marked creature attempts to harm any creature but you, they take an amount of force damage equal to your proficiency bonus plus intelligence modifier.</p>",
